ZiBXKdluRU7Vw99DlQRI5cdwb9_uoqWJZDqg0WkBshJcNNXOTLhL-uQEk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSh13-yYeBU6XyMiWgIzNyS6_SDheJFr3EdpUL66q_M1A&oe=6B09C946"}, {"file_name": "02-detail.png", "id": "1683881019522173", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_1683881026188839_4148983970693008391_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q6VIU9I8qh8Q7kNvwELeXeI&_nc_oc=AdrPLV2A-Z0rbcVVkR_x5J5LrngUN4Vlf_LTVvo8Bj4RF8aFyC2ah3SLuYCjebFZ4pc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQm0us-XxuUOBr5cQtzrVkb5dMWBVXCqxeSLC2X84WQww&oe=6B09A729"}, {"file_name": "04-home.png", "id": "1325026019199598", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_1325026022532931_3150413738957407970_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=npeTBYwqDU4Q7kNvwE_F6SB&_nc_oc=AdqXg0xiAM21jUEG4iWq93WSqIEjgWVzoBySHs1gQN0MVcaApSbrLEESRymp-zvrER8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcOLA5YlwTghdRRy79U813caUe0Ll5_lC2wZ_s8MdV2A&oe=6B09CA55"}, {"file_name": "03-library.png", "id": "996527066514223", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827585_996527069847556_5707853987992938826_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FFaClns9lPoQ7kNvwEu1IAG&_nc_oc=Adpsz7zEsIfVU0SVLWwLb11KtQuL2B5Bu7t-gSDsEpEoHm84UVrmReJD62jXLJJt6xI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSS-f8USW3JeplNDvvCe-t5Yd6zk7sci7mHVQDGe1yw9Q&oe=6B09C38F"}, {"file_name": "06-network.png", "id": "2401194624048722", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_2401194627382055_1059502897790844367_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uGp4tESa1AIQ7kNvwEOVWPE&_nc_oc=AdrHFXet6tNpv84m9OA0cUfXZYZCX7QOQlnVTs0FjzV87DsHXV6blONYFlFinmZMH00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQh4JEv_2Re7__2hHnsDLnCkqWATZXVzLsMhfwAi8gfdg&oe=6B09B8B3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "koko VR Theater", "keywords": ["plex", "jellyfin", "cinema", "vr180", "movies"], "long_description": "**Your library. Your cinema. Your headset.**\n\nkoko VR Theater turns your Quest into a private cinema for video you already own. Sign in to any Plex or Jellyfin server \u2014 yours, a friend's, or family's \u2014 or browse your NAS and local files. No accounts, ads, or subscriptions.\n\n**Play almost anything**\n- 2D, 3D (SBS / Top-Bottom / Frame-Sequential), VR180 / VR360\n- Apple spatial video (MV-HEVC), 3D Blu-ray (MVC), fisheye\n- HDR10, HLG, Dolby Vision; auto format detection\n\n**Looks better than the source**\n- Real-time AI upscaling (MQSR + NIS)\n- Per-title calibration: brightness, contrast, saturation, gamma, geometry\n- Up to native 8K from your servers and DRM-free web\n\n**Your whole collection, organised**\n- Plex & Jellyfin first-class \u2014 hubs, history, subtitles, audio tracks\n- Local, USB & network: SMB, FTP, SFTP, WebDAV, DLNA/UPnP\n- Tag, filter, sort, custom libraries; offline downloads; bookmarks & resume\n\n**Comfort & immersion**\n- Crisp UI, hand tracking, built-in VR web browser\n- Passthrough and skyboxes; spatial audio; subtitle styling; seated comfort\n\n**Watch together (optional)**\n- Private rooms with synced playback, voice chat, reactions; mute/block/report\n\n**Good to know:** commercial streaming (Netflix, Prime, Disney+) plays in theater-mode SD through the in-app browser due to hardware DRM. Full native resolution \u2014 up to 8K \u2014 applies to your own Plex/Jellyfin/NAS, local files, and DRM-free web like YouTube. koko plays content you own or are authorised to access.\n", "short_description": "Watch your own movies in a personal VR cinema. Connect Plex, Jellyfin, your NAS,\nUSB or local files. 2D, 3D, VR180/360, HDR \u2014 AI-upscaled and razor-sharp."}]}, "developer_name": "Krafti", "developer_privacy_